{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id42193016"}, "name":{"label":"Steve Canadian"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-15T23:43:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.9"}, "id":{"label":"10700992078"}, "title":{"label":"Lacking Customization, Stopped Innovating"}, "content":{"label":"This app and its developer revolutionized the podcast space when it came out. Its voice boost and smart speed features are now must haves for anyone who has ever used this app. \n\nNot so anymore. The app has always lacked customization options, another developer who thinks Apple doing similar is a virtue worth copying. Of course users miss out and it becomes a self fulfilling prophecy. Extremely limited selection of widgets, no one uses them, therefore why improve something no one uses. \n\nThe app which built itself on new and innovative features is now being outflanked by Read It Later apps who are now offering things like transcripts.\n\nIf the subscription is just paying for servers and maintenance it should be cheaper… or get back to what made this app great in the first place.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
