{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id139786037"}, "name":{"label":"amywithawhyy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-26T21:56:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.9"}, "id":{"label":"10630086992"}, "title":{"label":"Used to love this app but it’s barely functional now…"}, "content":{"label":"Feeling frustrated as I came to this app to get rid of the Apple podcast app, but it feels like all the reasons I got rid of Apple are now creeping into this app. First, it’s so slow and laggy to the point of ridiculousness. I can tap on something and wait ten seconds for to react. And then other times it’s so sensitive to something like a swipe that it recognizes it as a tap. Beyond frustrating. Second I’ve searched through the app high and low to figure out why it downloads some epsiodes despite having “stream only” selected. Randomly I’ll have 5GB of episodes downloaded that I have to delete. I don’t want to download! I want to be able to save an episode to a playlist without it downloading. I literally just want a list of episodes I’m interested in to refer back to. But it seems no app wants to give me that. Third, there’s no option to see previously listened episodes. I don’t understand why this is. Like, if I’m having a conversation with someone and I want to refer back to something I listened to… good luck figuring out which episode it was. I don’t want to download it for this purpose either. Just a darn list. Why is this so hard to get? Fourth, most recent update was for “artwork”?!? Who cares??? Who goes to a podcast app to look at the artwork? I want the app to function, have a legit stream only option, have a history, and that’s about it. When I’m listening to podcasts rather than watching a video it’s specifically because I will be doing something where I won’t be able to look at my screen much. I want the usability, functionality, and listening options to be great. I literally couldn’t care less about the art work. Am I alone in this?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
