{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id85710881"}, "name":{"label":"Drvannostren"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-10-06T15:52:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.9"}, "id":{"label":"10446610959"}, "title":{"label":"Works well until it doesn’t"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used overcast for a long time and it’s fine. It’s good, better than the Apple app imo. \n\nBut then sometimes it’s just not. When your downloaded content gets too big, even if you have lots of storage left, the app just kinda dies. It becomes unresponsive, you try and delete some content, for some reason the app just brings it back. Lots of issues and it becomes totally unusable.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
