{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id344757225"}, "name":{"label":"JG Photo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-09-26T01:11:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.9"}, "id":{"label":"10408292122"}, "title":{"label":"Used to be great"}, "content":{"label":"This app used to be one of my favourites on my phone. Slowly there are more and more annoying little things that make me look for an alternative again. \n\nThe record of previous shows I listened to is randomly incorrect\n\nNo grid view of my shows, so a lot if scrolling\n\nAlerts don’t work properly\n\nAnd just last week the app deleted everything I had subscribed to and showed me a blank App. I don’t update or anything, just happened while I was using it and then customer support didn’t get back to me. \n\nIt is still a good looking Podcast App and works, but for my taste its glorious days seem to be over.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
