{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id100174211"}, "name":{"label":"Luber905"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-27T07:04:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"9866794245"}, "title":{"label":"Yup. It’s good."}, "content":{"label":"I love Apple apps for the most part. But Outcast picks up where Apple Podcasts leaves off. \n\nThere’s so much customization that I can’t imagine another feature I could possibly need. I especially appreciate things like the speed variability that crushes the listening time on podcasts. There’s Siri compatibility. There’s a much better layout to scroll your downloaded podcasts and then select the show descriptions if needed. \n\nAlso for some reason it seems to update better so that new episodes show up more readily than Apple Podcasts does.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
