{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id42006246"}, "name":{"label":"BaltyQc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-21T16:57:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.3"}, "id":{"label":"9738148027"}, "title":{"label":"Per-fect"}, "content":{"label":"Really. This app is the best one for podcast. By far. And I tested all of them.\n\nExcept tiny TINY détails in the ***CarPlay*** UI (and this note is for the developper)\n-Missing symbol to go to next chapter (when present)\n-Missing symbol to mark a podcast as read, when we don’t want to listen to it anymore.\n-In the chapters list, it would be nice if the UI move to the current chapter (and not only showing a waveform animation). In order to see the next chapters without having to scroll down up to the current chapter of the playing podcast.\n\nThanks for you work !", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
